config BR2_PACKAGE_RPI_FIRMWARE_START4
	bool "rpi-firmware-start4"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_RPI_FIRMWARE_VARIANT_PI4
	help
	  A newer Raspberry Pi 4 GPU firmware (start4.elf, fixup4.dat)
	  than Buildroot's rpi-firmware, which the boot partition
	  takes instead of its copies (genimage.cfg).
	  Buildroot's cannot start the VL805 USB controller of a Pi 4
	  with a May 2026 bootloader EEPROM.

	  https://github.com/raspberrypi/firmware
